#: scenario5:scenario5_5184B641_BE1E_41EC_ACA3_AF447236AA65
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 344afb0ff51db51e195fc2e42d2a790f8b975c74c651c95338322619995e9545
