#: scenario5:scenario5_F987E310_0542_4FA0_ADCA_98946A2FFDBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1e99118a31918d7573b7b8983898a7ee894f00b5e67bb862d628ab2c9092ed8
